==Battleground==
*10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 15.33~18.67 seconds<sup>460f~560f</sup>.
*4 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~45.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,360f</sup>.
*3 [[Suidae Piggicus|Suidae Piggici]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 41.33~44.67 seconds<sup>1,240f~1,340f</sup>.
*1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*4 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 74.67 seconds<sup>2,240f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Beast Rajakong]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The goal here is to kill Nimoy Bore before Rajakong comes. If you can achieve this fast enough, you can just rush the base before Rajakong even spawns.
Bring some anti-Alien units such as [[Seafarer Cat]] and [[Catellite]] to deal with the initial enemies.
If you can't kill the base fast enough and you are forced to fight Rajakong, [[Ramen Cat]] with the help of Research [[Cat Combo]]s can stall him fine and [[Mushroom Cat]] (if owned) can nuke him with ease.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]]: Very good at dealing with all the Aliens until Rajakong comes.
*[[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]]: Deals [[Massive Damage]] to Rajakong, along with [[Behemoth Slayer]] and can nearly kill it by itself if the Nimoy Bore is down.
*[[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]]: Will [[Freeze]] the Nimoy Bore, allowing your attackers to kill him easily, especially with [[Talents]].
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]: He is almost always useful for [[Behemoth Culling]] stages. His high stats allow him to deal with Suidae Piggici and chip down Rajakong.
*[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]]: His really high HP and [[Resistant|Resistance]] to Angels will tank Rajakong with ease.
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]: Can nuke down the Nimoy Bore (and the base if it comes his way) before Rajakong has a chance to spawn. His [[Explosion]] Talent helps deal with the Suidae Piggici and other peons.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|Bazibastra]]: Can nuke the life out of the Scissoroos, Piggici, and Nimoy Bore. Also acts like a secondary wall if you somehow start getting pushed back.
*[[Ushiwakamaru (Legend Rare Cat)|Ushiwakamaru/Colossal Benkei]]: If you don't have Mushroom but do have this guy, he works equally as well against Rajakong. Beware the Evolved Form's high cost though.

